{"nodes": [{"type": "file", "id": "a549caff404d4451", "x": -175, "y": -188, "width": 350, "height": 375, "color": "#f5c2e7", "file": ".trash/mange manger manger/Photosynthese.md", "subpath": null}, {"type": "text", "id": "6ee551c225d0494c", "x": 310, "y": -67, "width": 280, "height": 135, "color": "#cba6f7", "text": "**processus biologique**\n\ntransformation se d\u00e9roulant dans un organisme vivant ou entre plusieurs organismes en interaction, mettant en jeux habituellement des r\u00e9actions chimiques ou d'autres natures"}, {"type": "file", "id": "3f73871ad4364a46", "x": 40, "y": 255, "width": 200, "height": 150, "color": null, "file": "images/Calvin-cycle4.svg", "subpath": null}, {"type": "text", "id": "20d392339ace4f39", "x": 0, "y": 415, "width": 280, "height": 185, "color": "#a6e3a1", "text": "**Cycle de Calvin**\n\nLe cycle de Calvin (aussi connu comme le cycle de Calvin-Benson-Bassham) est une s\u00e9rie de r\u00e9actions biochimiques  des organismes photosynth\u00e9tiques ayant lieu dans le stroma des chloroplastes chez les ..."}, {"type": "text", "id": "7c1462cbe6824231", "x": -504, "y": 209, "width": 280, "height": 110, "color": "#89dceb", "text": "**light-dependent reactions**\n\nchemical reactions involved in photosynthesis induced by light"}, {"type": "text", "id": "3f8ee2e0c31a4957", "x": -504, "y": -319, "width": 280, "height": 110, "color": "#fab387", "text": "**photosynthesis, dark reaction**\n\ncomplex cycle of enzyme-mediated reactions which catalyzes the reduction of carbon dioxide to sugar"}, {"type": "text", "id": "71f7ef0870da473a", "x": 0, "y": -482, "width": 280, "height": 110, "color": "#f9e2af", "text": "**m\u00e9tabolisme cellulaire**\n\nthe chemical reactions and pathways by which individual cells transform chemical substances"}], "edges": [{"id": "2eaf0b54afa44cac", "fromNode": "a549caff404d4451", "fromSide": "right", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "6ee551c225d0494c", "toSide": "left", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "est un(e)"}, {"id": "1e153cbf1b154150", "fromNode": "a549caff404d4451", "fromSide": "bottom", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "20d392339ace4f39", "toSide": "top", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "comprend"}, {"id": "97f8535f47764b32", "fromNode": "a549caff404d4451", "fromSide": "left", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "7c1462cbe6824231", "toSide": "right", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "comprend"}, {"id": "e7d60eb84d4549f4", "fromNode": "a549caff404d4451", "fromSide": "left", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "3f8ee2e0c31a4957", "toSide": "right", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "comprend"}, {"id": "62490febf16e455a", "fromNode": "a549caff404d4451", "fromSide": "top", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "71f7ef0870da473a", "toSide": "bottom", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "est un type de"}]}